                "description": "The Utica contemporary door lever features a rectangular rose and rectangular lever handle. This door lever is not only contemporary but its unique shape is ultra sleek making it an excellent choice for those who like a more minimalistic look. Available in your choice of oil rubbed bronze or satin nickel finishes. The Utica Lever With Rectangular Woodward Rose is adjustable to fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. The backset is also adjustable for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches with a removable faceplate.\r\n",
